@page "/features"
@layout MarketingLayout

<PageTitle>Features | My Active Vitals</PageTitle>

<header class="marketing-page-hero">
    <p class="marketing-kicker">Features</p>
    <h1>One connected view of your daily health.</h1>
    <p>Track important details, reduce duplicate work, and turn individual entries into trends you can actually use.</p>
</header>

<section class="marketing-section">
    <div class="marketing-feature-row">
        <div class="marketing-copy">
            <p class="marketing-kicker">Nutrition</p>
            <h2>Understand more than calories.</h2>
            <p>Build a personal food history with nutrients that matter to your goals, including renal-conscious tracking.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="marketing-feature-panel">
            <strong>Nutrition tools</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>Calories, protein, sodium, potassium, and phosphorus</li>
                <li>Fluid intake and serving details</li>
                <li>Phosphate binder entries and net phosphorus totals</li>
                <li>AI-assisted nutrition estimates with a monthly allowance</li>
                <li>Daily, meal-based, and historical views</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="marketing-feature-row">
        <div class="marketing-copy">
            <p class="marketing-kicker">Exercise</p>
            <h2>Connect movement with the rest of your routine.</h2>
            <p>Record exercise sessions and review activity alongside weight and nutrition patterns.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="marketing-feature-panel">
            <strong>Exercise tools</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>Exercise type, start time, duration, and intensity</li>
                <li>Entered or estimated calories burned</li>
                <li>Session history and activity trends</li>
                <li>Notes for personal context</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="marketing-feature-row">
        <div class="marketing-copy">
            <p class="marketing-kicker">Vitals and labs</p>
            <h2>Keep important measurements organized.</h2>
            <p>Maintain a consistent personal record across the health measurements you follow most often.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="marketing-feature-panel">
            <strong>Tracking tools</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>Blood pressure and pulse</li>
                <li>Blood glucose readings</li>
                <li>Weight and BMI context</li>
                <li>Kidney lab history</li>
                <li>Dates, times, and personal notes</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="marketing-feature-row">
        <div class="marketing-copy">
            <p class="marketing-kicker">Analytics</p>
            <h2>Move from entries to patterns.</h2>
            <p>Use dashboards, totals, and trend views to understand changes over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="marketing-feature-panel">
            <strong>Analysis tools</strong>
            <ul>
                <li>At-a-glance daily dashboard</li>
                <li>Recent and longer-term trend views</li>
                <li>Nutrition and exercise summaries</li>
                <li>Personal thresholds and tracking preferences</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="marketing-cta">
    <h2>Bring your tracking together.</h2>
    <p>Choose monthly or annual access and begin with a planned seven-day trial.</p>
    <a class="marketing-button" href="pricing">View plans</a>
</section>
